Notes for National Academy for Learning:

- This license covers the Teacher Studio tool itself (the HTML/JS application
  code in this repository) so it is clear the code may be used, copied, and
  modified freely within and beyond the school.
- It does NOT cover the content of documents the tool generates from your own
  resources (Goody Bag activities, syllabus PDFs, sample lesson plans, school
  branding/logo). Those remain the property of National Academy for Learning
  and their original sources, and are not redistributed under this license.
- Every lesson plan and Plan of Work exported by the tool carries a footer
  line ("© [year] National Academy for Learning — for internal classroom use.
  Generated with the NAFL Teacher Studio.") identifying it as school material
  generated by this tool, for internal use.
- If you intend to publish this repository publicly on GitHub, MIT is a
  permissive choice that allows others to reuse the code; swap this file for
  a different license (or mark the repo private) if you'd prefer to keep the
  tool internal to the school only.
